{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"“Riemann–Hilbert 对应”"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"Riemann--Hilbert对应"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>Riemann–Hilbert 对应是 "},{"Local":{"url":"D-模","text":"D-模"}},{"Plain":"理论的基本定理, 解答了 "},{"Local":{"url":"Hilbert第21问题","text":"Hilbert 第 21 问题"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>Riemann–Hilbert 对应的最简单版本是: 一个空间上的"},{"Local":{"url":"平坦向量丛","text":"可积联络"}},{"Plain":"范畴对应"},{"Local":{"url":"局部系统","text":"局部系统"}},{"Plain":"的范畴.</p>\n"}]}}